            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My husband and I enjoyed this one cold New England evening with a nice loaf of warm bread! (I tried it in the crockpot and it came out great~although it does take more time!)\r\nThanks ANGIE!!",
            "datePublished": "2000-02-28T16:38:30.010Z"
